flowchart TD
    A([Provider run: a new record,<br/>or an identity field changed]) --> B[Clean the text<br/>uppercase, strip punctuation, cut to Zip5]
    B --> C{Zip5 equal<br/>to the other record}
    C -->|No| NO[Text score 0<br/>different station, full stop]
    C -->|Yes| D[Score in proportion<br/>adjacent character pairs, sorted then compared<br/>address 40 - name 10 - postal 25 - province 15 - city 10<br/>coordinates run beside it as evidence, never as points]
    D --> F{Label}
    F -->|text 80 or more| HIGH[HIGH_SUSPECT]
    F -->|text 50 to 79| MED[MEDIUM_SUSPECT]
    F -->|text below 50| NONE[Not a pair]
    HIGH --> G[Person reads A and B<br/>one row per judged field, weight chip on the left]
    MED --> G
    G --> H{Disposition - three, not two}
    H -->|same station| M[Disable one record<br/>write merged_into<br/>the keeper keeps the OC location]
    H -->|two tenants at one address| T[Both stay active<br/>each keeps its own OC location<br/>both labelled same address]
    H -->|the address is wrong| X[Park the pair<br/>nothing written]
    M --> V[One store, n records<br/>exactly one live source]
    T --> V
    X --> RE[Re-judged on the next provider run]
    RE --> G
    NONE --> U[Normal provider update<br/>the value flows, drift only]
    U --> V
